From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: expose Neighborhood accessible root

Give the GTK4 Neighborhood root a stable accessible name and group role. This
does not alter peer, Activity, or NetworkManager behavior.

--- a/src/jarabe/desktop/meshbox.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/desktop/meshbox.py
@@ -370,1 +370,3 @@
         self.set_focusable(False)
+        self.update_property([Gtk.AccessibleProperty.LABEL],
+                             [_('Neighborhood')])
+        self.set_accessible_role(Gtk.AccessibleRole.GROUP)
